    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d631-a1">

                <pb facs="0758" n="638" sameAs="frus:frus1905/pg638"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure I.—Translation.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Minister of Foreign Affairs to Ambassador
                        Clayton.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of Foreign Affairs</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Mexico</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1905-04-28"><hi rendition="#italic">April 28,
                        1905</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Mr. Ambassador</hi>: Referring to your excellency’s
                    note, dated the 10th of March last, relative to the case brought against the
                    persons supposed to be guilty of the murder of J. C. Maxwell, J. B. Maxwell, and
                    Enoch Woodworth, I have the honor to transmit to your excellency herewith a copy
                    of a communication addressed to me by the governor of the State of Sonora
                    informing me of the status of said case.</p>
                <p>I renew, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Igno. Mariscal.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
